sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Platform
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MLflowCtrl as MLflowReconciler<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant Helm as Helm Chart Renderer<br/>(in-process)
    participant OpCtrl as MLflowOperatorReconciler
    participant NSCtrl as NamespaceRBACReconciler
    participant TLSWatch as TLS Profile Watcher
    participant Prom as Prometheus Scraper
    participant Kubelet as Kubelet

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 1: MLflow Instance Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update MLflow CR
    K8sAPI-->>MLflowCtrl: Watch event (MLflow CR change)<br/>TLS, ServiceAccount
    MLflowCtrl->>Helm: Render Helm chart templates<br/>(in-process, charts/mlflow)
    Helm-->>MLflowCtrl: Kubernetes manifests<br/>(Deployments, Services, Jobs, etc.)
    MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Apply managed resources<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
    MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Read mlflow-artifact-connection Secret<br/>HTTPS/6443, RBAC resourceNames-scoped

    opt Gateway API CRD available
        MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
    end

    opt prometheus-operator CRD available
        MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceMonitor<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
    end

    opt OpenShift Console CRD available
        MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConsoleLink<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
    end

    Note over Prom,Kubelet: Flow 2: Operator Metrics and Probes

    Prom->>MLflowCtrl: GET :8443/metrics<br/>HTTPS, TLS (self-signed default)
    Note right of Prom: Auth: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    MLflowCtrl-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics response

    Kubelet->>MLflowCtrl: GET :8081/healthz<br/>HTTP, No auth
    MLflowCtrl-->>Kubelet: 200 OK (Ping)

    Kubelet->>MLflowCtrl: GET :8081/readyz<br/>HTTP, No auth
    MLflowCtrl-->>Kubelet: 200 OK (Ping)

    Note over TLSWatch,K8sAPI: Flow 3: TLS Profile Adherence

    TLSWatch->>K8sAPI: Watch apiservers.config.openshift.io/cluster<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>TLSWatch: TLS profile / adherence change detected
    TLSWatch->>MLflowCtrl: Trigger graceful shutdown for reload

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 4: Namespace RBAC Reconciliation

    K8sAPI-->>NSCtrl: Watch event (Namespace change)<br/>TLS, ServiceAccount
    NSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Read MLflow instances<br/>HTTPS/6443
    NSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update/Delete RoleBindings<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
